# Normalize line endings.
#
# Every blob committed to this repository is LF, and CI runs on ubuntu-latest,
# so the Biome formatter is configured for LF. Without this file a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true) produces a CRLF working copy in which
# `biome ci sdks` fails on every file while CI passes — the local verification
# suite in refactor-progress.md §6 becomes unrunnable.
#
# text=auto detects binary content and leaves it alone; the explicit -text
# entries below make that guarantee non-inferred for the assets we ship.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png -text
*.jpg -text
*.gif -text
*.ico -text
*.woff -text
*.woff2 -text
